# MATLAB Generated Images

Dette directory indeholder grafer genereret af MATLAB scriptet `Docs/Matlab/Coil_Design_Multilayer.m`.

## Forventede filer:
- `tx_turns_vs_inductance.png` - TX vindinger vs induktans kurve
- `tx_current_vs_resistance.png` - H-bro TX strøm vs total modstand (ved resonans)

## Generer grafer:
Kør `Coil_Design_Multilayer.m` i MATLAB for at generere/opdatere graferne.
